+		<English>The earliest armed naval vessel, [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galleys[COLOR_REVERT] can transport land units. They cannot enter ocean spaces. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] gives this +1 speed and slightly reduces the cost, and K-Mod increases the cargo capacity of all transport ships.</English>
